{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1455288-haslanti-league-in-3e","id":1455288,"title":"Haslanti League in 3E","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2021-07-20T20:50:01-07:00","id":1455288,"title":"Haslanti League in 3E","content":"<span style=\"font-family:arial\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Hi,</span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\">Has anyone been using the Haslanti League in their 3E games? If so, I'd love any advice or interesting setting ideas you might like to share. </span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\">I\u2019m starting a game set in the North, primarily around the Haslanti League. I am drawing on content from Bastions of the North, but fitting it in with the little info we have on the region for 3E. Among other things, I\u2019m trying to decide where to put the main League towns that aren\u2019t on the 3E core map, and this is my current version:</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:arial\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/12vKIQuXxTPJpXIpeAqUb3GTN55O9IAuO/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\">https://drive.google.com/file/d/12vKIQuXxTPJpXIpeAqUb3GTN55O9IAuO/view?usp=sharing</span></a></span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:arial\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Note: that regional map is based on Kashi\u2019s v1.3 map at </span><a href=\"https://imgur.com/gallery/OWk3CED\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\">https://imgur.com/gallery/OWk3CED</span></a></span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:arial\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">My reasons for the chosen locations are:</span></span></span><ul><li><span style=\"font-family:arial\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Fair Isle - it is a fairly small place, one of the westernmost sites in the League, and I thought putting it near the Shattered Bastion would be interesting.</span></span></span></li> <li><span style=\"font-family:arial\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Fort Bear - in the foothills of the mountains there, and is the closest League city to the merchants coming up from Sijan, Rubylak, etc. whether by land or river/sea, which creates the tension with Icehome described in BotN.</span></span></span></li> <li><span style=\"font-family:arial\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Shield - something should be in this stretch of coast, and Shield is supposed to be (ineffectively) guarding the League against regional threats, and this area is near both a Fae court and a shadowland based on the approximate locations from prior editions.</span></span></span></li> <li><span style=\"font-family:arial\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Iron Falls - a mining town, so it has the mountains right there, but also named for a large waterfall. I\u2019m putting a large Niagara Falls-scale waterfall here that has the full flow from the northeastern lakes coming down to the White Sea. I\u2019m thinking about having a 1st Age bridge that crosses the river chasm here, providing the only land route to Tusk and the far north.</span></span></span></li> <li><span style=\"font-family:arial\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Windcreche - still the last port before Crystal, although now just for sea traffic. Still, any shipments too large/heavy for airships will come down the trade route from Crystal to Windcreche to be shipped south. </span></span></span></li> </ul><span style=\"font-family:arial\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">If anyone has any feedback, or other suggestions for the region, please let me know.</span></span><br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26886-lindharin","name":"Lindharin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"33"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}